      "raw_url": "https://github.com/python/cpython/raw/d94417e52078bc5f07c609362fc52ca8f0bc68fc/Misc%2FNEWS.d%2Fnext%2FCore_and_Builtins%2F2026-07-30-14-30-00.gh-issue-148286.Wn5Tz4.rst",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/contents/Misc%2FNEWS.d%2Fnext%2FCore_and_Builtins%2F2026-07-30-14-30-00.gh-issue-148286.Wn5Tz4.rst?ref=d94417e52078bc5f07c609362fc52ca8f0bc68fc",
      "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@\n+Fix undefined behaviour in ``_PyObject_MergePerThreadRefcounts()`` on the\n+free-threaded build. The per-thread reference count delta being merged is\n+routinely negative, and it was shifted left by ``_Py_REF_SHARED_SHIFT``,\n+which is undefined behaviour for a negative value. The shift is now done in\n+the unsigned domain."
    },
    {
      "sha": "e6e2c3eadcb434efd2b141deb36bd19c26dde048",
      "filename": "Python/uniqueid.c",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 5,
      "deletions": 1,
      "changes": 6,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/d94417e52078bc5f07c609362fc52ca8f0bc68fc/Python%2Funiqueid.c",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/python/cpython/raw/d94417e52078bc5f07c609362fc52ca8f0bc68fc/Python%2Funiqueid.c",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python/cpython/contents/Python%2Funiqueid.c?ref=d94417e52078bc5f07c609362fc52ca8f0bc68fc",
      "patch": "@@ -181,8 +181,12 @@ _PyObject_MergePerThreadRefcounts(_PyThreadStateImpl *tstate)\n         Py_ssize_t refcnt = tstate->refcounts.values[i];\n         if (refcnt != 0) {\n             PyObject *obj = pool->table[i].obj;\n+            /* `refcnt` is a per-thread delta, so it is routinely negative,\n+               and shifting a negative value left is undefined behaviour.\n+               Shift in the unsigned domain instead. */\n             _Py_atomic_add_ssize(&obj->ob_ref_shared,\n-                                 refcnt << _Py_REF_SHARED_SHIFT);\n+                                 (Py_ssize_t)((size_t)refcnt\n+                                              << _Py_REF_SHARED_SHIFT));\n             tstate->refcounts.values[i] = 0;\n         }\n     }"
    }
